#: /home/alaraajavamma/claude/telephony/src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:829
msgid ""
"This is the base hardware volume applied to the selected output when a call "
"connects. The volume buttons during a call only adjust fine-tuning on top of "
"this base level, so if the base is 0% the call stays silent no matter what. "
"Values above 100% use software amplification and may distort audio. Wired "
"Headset and Bluetooth levels are stored for upcoming routing support."
msgstr ""
"Haec est sonoritas machinalis fundamentalis quae exitui selecto applicatur "
"cum vocatio conectitur. Globuli sonoritatis inter vocationem solum subtilem "
"accommodationem super hunc gradum fundamentalem mutant; itaque si "
"fundamentum 0% est, vocatio semper silet. Valores supra 100% amplificatione "
"programmatis utuntur et sonum distorquere possunt. Gradus Auscultatorii "
"filati et Bluetooth pro futuro auxilio derivationis servantur."

